Adds an empty period-opening table with tenant-scoped references, audit evidence, and guards for future changes to annual carry-in and contribution-program balances. Reference indexes include the existing primary-key identifiers, which already guarantee uniqueness. Existing annual balances, payroll runs, stubs, and posted financial history are neither rewritten nor reinterpreted; no period attribution is inferred from existing data. The annual-bound guards apply only when an explicit period opening has been recorded, so there are no existing period rows to inspect before installation.
